{'symbol': 'CHTR', 'date': '2022-08-04 20:16:00', 'title': 'CHARTER PRICES $1.5 BILLION SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN. , AUG. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHARTER COMMUNICATIONS, INC. (NASDAQ: CHTR) (ALONG\xa0WITH ITS SUBSIDIARIES, "CHARTER") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARIES, CCO HOLDINGS, LLC AND CCO HOLDINGS CAPITAL CORP. (COLLECTIVELY, THE "ISSUERS"), HAVE PRICED $1.5 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2029 (THE "NOTES").'}